      "body": "Hi! I'd like to take this one — could you assign it to me? Plan: add an `InfoTooltip` next to the \"Ultra-processing level\" label in Compare mode with a one-sentence explanation of the NOVA groups (1 = unprocessed/minimally processed … 4 = ultra-processed), plus a small \"Learn more\" link to https://world.openfoodfacts.org/nova. Strings go through svelte-i18n.\n\nDisclosure: this contribution is being prepared with an AI agent (Claude Code, Claude Fable 5, agentic) operating under my GitHub account; I review and take responsibility for the code.",
